      <manifestationList xml:id="sourceDesc_660af2a6">
         <manifestation label="" xml:id="source_0ccb6a91">
            <titleStmt xml:id="titleStmt_9828ea3c">
               <title xml:id="title_4472f5a9">Short score, autograph, fair copy</title>
            </titleStmt>
            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_ca28b952">
               <extent xml:id="extent_5fb6386a">4 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_c7462a10">34 x 26</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_fd24a437">1 bifolio stitched together with a folio glued on the original p. 4. Written in purple ink. Paper: 18 staves. Music written on 4 staves with indication of instruments. Above the music Hartmann has written: "Tænkt til Benyttelse ved Afsløringen / af Mindesmærket for N.W. Gade." At the bottom of the page he has added: "Efter dette Udkast har Kgl. Kapelmusikus Thorvald Hansen arrangeret et Partitur, som brugtes ved Afsløringen d. 24<rend xml:id="idm33" rend="sup">de</rend> Juni under Nerudas Anførelse." At the end of the music on p. 4 dated: "ii/3 97".</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
            <classification xml:id="classification_38effa3e">
               <termList xml:id="termList_8f932697">
